sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant ST as Storage
    participant DT as YOLO Detector
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>UI: Select image and click Analyze
    UI->>API: POST /workspaces/{id}/analyze/image
    API->>API: Check login, membership, model loaded
    API->>ST: Save upload (type and size check)
    ST-->>API: File path
    API->>DT: detect(frame)
    DT-->>API: Boxes, behaviours, confidence
    API->>API: Draw boxes with OpenCV
    API->>DB: Save analysis and detections
    API-->>UI: 201 result with counts and detections
    UI-->>U: Annotated image and table
